      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meadow_Lake%2C_Saskatchewan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town sits in Saskatchewan’s boreal forest, about 246 kilometres northeast of Lloydminster.",
